{% comment %}
  Free rich text for the buy box.

  Unlimited and position-free: it is the block to reach for when a product needs
  one more line — a dosage note, a sourcing claim, a seasonal message — that no
  other block covers. Nothing is inferred from the product, so an empty block
  renders nothing at all.

  Accepts:
  - block {Object} - the text block. Reads settings.content.

  Usage:
  {% render 'CWC_pdp-text__block', block: block %}
{% endcomment %}

{%- if block.settings.content != blank -%}
  <div class="cwc_product-hero-buy-box__text cwc-rte" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
    {{ block.settings.content }}
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
